      "description": "Casting Burning Wish before the second Lion's Eye Diamond means you cannot execute the LED + Burning Wish + Echo of Eons combo. The correct line is to cast LED first (enabling metalcraft on Mox Opal), then cast Burning Wish holding priority, crack both LEDs to generate mana and discard Echo of Eons to graveyard, then after Burning Wish resolves, flashback Echo of Eons for {2}{U}.",
