      "description": "Wished for Echo of Eons when they already had one in hand and had the flashback line available via 2x Lion's Eye Diamond. The second copy adds nothing since they can crack LEDs to discard Echo and flash it back from the graveyard for {2}{U}. A different wish target would have added meaningful value to the combo turn.",
