      "severity": "major",
      "description": "GPT41m Analyst is playing the Painter's Servant + Grindstone combo deck. With Painter's Servant in hand and enough mana to cast it (2 mana available from Mountains, plus Lotus Petals), the Urza's Saga chapter III search should have fetched Grindstone to enable the combo kill. With Grindstone on the battlefield, casting Painter's Servant next would allow activating Grindstone (3 mana to activate) to mill the opponent's entire library since all cards share a color. Instead, they chose Mishra's Research Desk, a card advantage tool that doesn't advance the combo at all. The player has Painter's Servant in hand, two Grindstones available in the search options, and sufficient mana to execute the combo quickly. Fetching Research Desk delays the win by potentially multiple turns.",
